he date shown on the product page."}]]}]}],["$","div","Is there a discount for buying several pieces?",{"className":"border-b border-rule","children":["$","details",null,{"className":"group py-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-4","children":[["$","svg",null,{"aria-hidden":true,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","className":"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-ink transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"1.5","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M5 9l7 7 7-7"}]}],["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-body text-ink","children":"Is there a discount for buying several pieces?"}]]}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-body mt-3 pl-8 text-ink-body","children":"No. The price is what the weaver was paid plus what it costs us to sell it, and there is no margin built in to be given back. We would rather quote one honest number than an inflated one with a discount on top."}]]}]}],["$","div","Can several orders be sent together?",{"className":"border-b border-rule","children":["$","details",null,{"className":"group py-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-4","children":[["$","svg",null,{"aria-hidden":true,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","className":"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-ink transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"1.5","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M5 9l7 7 7-7"}]}],["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-body text-ink","children":"Can several orders be sent together?"}]]}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-body mt-3 pl-8 text-ink-body","children":"Yes, if they have not been dispatched yet — write to us and we will hold and combine them. Where a made-to-order piece is involved the whole parcel waits for it, so sometimes two parcels is the better answer."}]]}]}],["$","div","H