de once, for you, and there is no second buyer for a blouse cut to someone else's back. We would rather say that here than in small print later."}]]}]}],["$","div","Can I cancel an order?",{"className":"border-b border-rule","children":["$","details",null,{"className":"group py-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-4","children":[["$","svg",null,{"aria-hidden":true,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","className":"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-ink transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"1.5","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M5 9l7 7 7-7"}]}],["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-body text-ink","children":"Can I cancel an order?"}]]}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-body mt-3 pl-8 text-ink-body","children":"A ready-to-ship order, until it is dispatched. A commission, until the warp is set — after that the weaver has committed the loom and we have committed the money."}]]}]}]]}]]}]
